# Route for the big game. The chain runs through all 120 generated files: the route stays at the start of the chain (the
# first menus are taken by the harness auto-picker, the first choice of each menu moves forward). The load test is the
# launch itself: lint and the first probe read and compile every generated file.
# Ops: cmd TEXT | wait TOKEN | settle SECS | shot NAME [volatile] | note TEXT | quit
cmd auto on
cmd click on
wait menu True
cmd click off
settle 3
shot 01-menu
cmd start
after_start
cmd advance-to 1
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 02-first-label
cmd advance-to 40
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 03-chain-40
quit
